o-cid-y65miq3z>Find user frustration.</h3><p data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>See where your agent fails, users get frustrated, and churn begins. Every pattern links to the exact conversations and traces so you can fix it fast.</p></div></article><article class=\"agnost-capability\" data-astro-cid-y65miq3z><div class=\"agnost-capability-art\" data-capability-ascii data-capability-ascii-columns=\"83\" data-capability-ascii-scale=\"0.5\" style=\"--capability-ascii-color:#9254ff;--capability-ascii-width:320px;--capability-ascii-top:50%;--capability-ascii-scale:0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-y65miq3z><img data-src=\"/agnost-assets/capability-needs.png\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" data-astro-cid-y65miq3z><pre data-astro-cid-y65miq3z></pre></div><div class=\"agnost-capability-copy\" data-astro-cid-y65miq3z><h3 data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>Auto-cluster conversations.</h3><p data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>Turn thousands of chats into the recurring problems that disappoint users, ranked by impact and ready to investigate.</p></div></article><article class=\"agnost-capability\" data-astro-cid-y65miq3z><div class=\"agnost-capability-art\" data-capability-ascii data-capability-ascii-columns=\"104\" data-capability-ascii-scale=\"0.4\" style=\"--capability-ascii-color:#9254ff;--capability-ascii-width:317px;--capability-ascii-top:50%;--capability-ascii-scale:0.4\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-y65miq3z><img data-src=\"/agnost-assets/capability-questions.png\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" data-astro-cid-y65miq3z><pre data-astro-cid-y65miq3z></pre></div><div class=\"agnost-capability-copy\" data-astro-cid-y65miq3z><h3 data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>Prevent costly failures.</h3><p data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>Catch hallucinations, broken promises, and policy violations with the exact conversation and trace behind every failure.</p></div></article><article class=\"agnost-capability\" data-astro-cid-y65miq3z><div class=\"agnost-capability-art\" data-capability-ascii data-capability-ascii-columns=\"98\