pan></button></div></article><article><h3><span>\u2726</span>Catch churn before it happens.</h3><p>See exactly where users rage-prompt, get stuck, or give up. Then turn those moments into reviewed fixes before they cost you users.</p></article></div></section></div><script type=\"module\">document.querySelectorAll(`.agnost-about-command__copy`).forEach(e=>{e.addEventListener(`click`,async()=>{let t=e.dataset.copy;if(!t)return;try{await navigator.clipboard.writeText(t)}catch{let e=document.createElement(`textarea`);e.value=t,e.style.position=`fixed`,e.style.opacity=`0`,document.body.append(e),e.select(),document.execCommand(`copy`),e.remove()}let n=e.querySelector(`span`);n&&(n.textContent=`Copied`,e.classList.add(`is-copied`),window.setTimeout(()=>{n.textContent=`Copy`,e.classList.remove(`is-copied`)},1600))})});</script><section id=\"pricing\" class=\"agnost-section agnost-pricing agnost-product-pricing\" data-astro-cid-y65miq3z><div class=\"agnost-container\" data-astro-cid-y65miq3z><div class=\"agnost-reference-heading\" data-astro-cid-y65miq3z><p class=\"agnost-tag\" data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>Pricing</p><h2 data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>Start free.<br data-astro-cid-y65miq3z><span data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>Scale when you're ready.</span></h2><p data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>The earlier you start ingesting conversations, the smarter your agent gets, so connect today.</p></div><div class=\"agnost-product-pricing__grid\" data-astro-cid-y65miq3z><article class=\"agnost-product-pricing__card\" data-astro-cid-y65miq3z><span class=\"agnost-product-pricing__tag\" data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>Free</span><h3 data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>Free</h3><ul data-astro-cid-y65miq3z><li data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>Intents and sentiment, discovered automatically</li><li data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>Violations across quality, policy, and compliance</li><li data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>Alerts for silent failures and rising friction</li><li data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>Self-improvement suggestions for your agent</li><li data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>Up to 1,000 events / mo</li><li data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>7-day data retention</li></ul><p data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>The full product for agents in early production.</p><a href=\"https://app.agnost.ai\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>Start Free</a></article><article class=\"agnost-product-pricing__card\" data-astro-cid-y65miq3z><span class=\"agnost-product-pricing__tag\" data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>Starter</span><h3 data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>$49<small data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>/mo</small></h3><ul data-astro-cid-y65miq3z><li data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>Everything in Free</li><li data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>Up to 10,000 events / mo</li><li data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>30-day data retention</li><li data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>Onboarding help</li></ul><p data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>More history and help getting set up.</p><a href=\"https://app.agnost.ai\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>Start Small</a></article><article class=\"agnost-product-pricing__card is-featured\" data-astro-cid-y65miq3z><span class=\"agnost-product-pricing__tag\" data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>Pro</span><h3 data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>$499<small data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>/mo</small></h3><ul data-astro-cid-y65miq3z><li data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>Everything in Starter</li><li data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>Up to 1,000,000 events / mo</li><li data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>90-day data retention</li><li data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>Founders Slack channel</li></ul><p data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>High-volume agents that need faster iteration.</p><a href=\"https://app.agnost.ai\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>Start Pro</a></article><article class=\"agnost-product-pricing__card\" data-astro-cid-y65miq3z><span class=\"agnost-product-pricing__tag\" data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>Enterprise</span><h3 data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>Custom</h3><ul data-astro-cid-y65miq3z><li data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>Everything in Pro</li><li data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>Custom event volume &amp; retention</li><li data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>Self-hosted VPC deployments</li><li data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>Audit logs</li><li data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>Custom SLAs &amp; SLOs</li><li data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>Custom improvement workflows</li></ul><p data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>Security, controls, and scale on your terms.</p><a href=\"https://cal.com/shubhamintech/agnost-enterprise-call\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>Let&#39;s Chat</a></article></div></div></section><section class=\"agnost-section agnost-faq\" id=\"faq\" data-astro-cid-y65miq3z><div class=\"agnost-container agnost-faq__grid\" data-astro-cid-y65miq3z><div class=\"agnost-faq__intro\" data-astro-cid-y65miq3z><p class=\"agnost-tag\" data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>FAQ</p><h2 data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>Questions,<br data-astro-cid-y65miq3z><span data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>answered.</span></h2><p data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>Everything you need to know before putting your production conversations to work.</p><a class=\"agnost-faq__contact\" href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#5a3c352f343e3f28291a3b3d3435292e743b33\" data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>Talk to the founders <span aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>\u2197</span></a></div><div class=\"agnost-faq__list\" data-astro-cid-y65miq3z><details class=\"agnost-faq__item\" data-astro-cid-y65miq3z><summary data-astro-cid-y65miq3z><span data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>I already have observability and traces. Why do I need Agnost?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>+</i></summary><p data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>Because a trace can say \u201csuccess\u201d when the user still got nothing useful. We read every trace alongside the conversation, map it back to the user, and catch the silent failures: the agent says it sent the PDF but it never arrived, or confidently answers the wrong question. You see how many users hit it, the traces behind it, and what to fix.</p></details><details class=\"agnost-faq__item\" data-astro-cid-y65miq3z><summary data-astro-cid-y65miq3z><span data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>Can\u2019t I just ask Claude or Codex to give me insights?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>+</i></summary><p data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>For a handful of chats, absolutely. But you are not going to keep pasting every new trace into Claude, working out which failures are the same, and checking whether they are getting worse. Agnost does that across your real traffic and keeps the conversation and trace next to every insight.</p></details><details class=\"agnost-faq__item\" data-astro-cid-y65miq3z><summary data-astro-cid-y65miq3z><span data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>Is my data secure?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>+</i></summary><p data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>The honest answer: we process the conversation data you choose to send us. Use pseudonymous IDs and redact secrets or sensitive fields before ingestion; transport uses HTTPS and dashboard access is authenticated. We do not pretend to automatically redact PII for you. If your team needs a security review, DPA, or a specific deployment setup, talk to us directly.</p></details><details class=\"agnost-faq__item\" data-astro-cid-y65miq3z><summary data-astro-cid-y65miq3z><span data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>How complicated is the setup?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>+</i></summary><p data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>You do not need to rebuild your agent or change how it works. Connect the events and conversations you already have, inspect one staging trace to make sure you are happy with what is being sent, and then turn it on. The point is to get insight from real traffic, not create another implementation project.</p></details><details class=\"agnost-faq__item\" data-astro-cid-y65miq3z><summary data-astro-cid-y65miq3z><span data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>Are the founders going to help me improve my agent?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>+</i></summary><p data-astro-cid-y65miq3z>Yeah. We are early, and we want to be in the loop with you: looking at what users are hitting, deciding what is actually worth fixing, and helping turn that into a better prompt, product flow, or eval. You can talk to the founders directly.</p></details></div></div></section></main><footer class=\"agnost-footer agnost-footer-reference\"><div class=\"agnost-footer-reference__frame\"><div class=\"agnost-footer-reference__art\"><div class=\"agnost-footer-ascii agnost-footer-ascii--light\" data-footer-ascii data-tone=\"light\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img src=\"/agnost-assets/hero-conversation-clusters-v5.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><canvas></canvas></div><script data-cfasync=\"false\" src=\"/cdn-cgi/scripts/5c5dd728/cloudflare-static/email-decode.min.js\"></script><script type=\"module\">for(let e of document.querySelectorAll(`[data-footer-ascii]`)){let t=e.querySelector(`img`),n=e.querySelector(`canvas`),r=n.getContext(`2d`),i=document.createElement(`canvas`),a=i.getContext(`2d`,{willReadFrequently:!0}),o=()=>{if(!r||!a||!t.naturalWidth)return;let o=n.getBoundingClientRect(),s=Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio||1,2),c=Math.max(1,Math.round(o.width*s)),l=Math.max(1,Math.round(o.height*s)),u=Math.max(58,Math.round(c/4.4)),d=Math.round(u*(t.naturalHeight/t.naturalWidth)*.58),f=c/u,p=l/d;n.width=c,n.height=l,i.width=u,i.height=d,a.drawImage(t,0,0,u,d);let m=a.getImageData(0,0,u,d).data;r.clearRect(0,0,c,l),r.textBaseline=`top`,r.font=`${Math.max(5,p*1.04)}px \"Fragment Mono\", ui-monospace, monospace`;for(let t=0;t<d;t+=1)for(let n=0;n<u;n+=1){let i=(t*u+n)*4,a=m[i]*.2126+m[i+1]*.7152+m[i+2]*.0722,o=e.dataset.tone===`light`?a/255:1-a/255;if(o<.1)continue;let s=Math.sqrt(o),c=Math.min(14,Math.max(1,Math.round(s*14)));r.fillStyle=`rgba(96, 96, 96, ${.18+s*.62})`,r.fillText(` .,:;i1tfLCG08@`[c],n*f,t*p)}},s=!1,c=()=>{s&&o()};new ResizeObserver(c).observe(n),t.addEventListener(`load`,c,{once:!0}),new IntersectionObserver(([e],t)=>{s=e.isIntersecting,s&&(o(),t.disconnect())},{rootMargin:`200px`}).observe(e)}</script></div><div cla